        "Content": "We are delighted to place on the market this superbly located residential site in one of Cork Counties most desirable coastal locations. This elevated site comprises of 0.21 Hectares / 0.52 Acres and has the benefit of three derelict buildings and enjoys stunning coastal views to include to Fastnet Rock in a tranquil private setting. The site is within walking distance of the village and all amenities in the area and viewing of this site comes highly recommended."
